    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<p><strong>The Next Step in Unlocking Microcurrent Healing Power</strong></p>\n<p>Meet the<span>\u00a0</span><strong>Avazzia Life Pinnacle Lite</strong><span>\u00a0</span>\u2014 the newest evolution in our breakthrough line of microcurrent devices. It delivers the power, precision, and performance of a professional-grade system in a form designed for both<span>\u00a0</span><strong>at-home users</strong><span>\u00a0</span>and<span>\u00a0</span><strong>clinicians</strong><span>\u00a0</span>alike \u2014 including doctors, natural healers, physical therapists, estheticians, veterinarians, and wellness practitioners.</p>\n<p>Microcurrent therapy is a<span>\u00a0</span><strong>proven, drug-free, and non-invasive</strong><span>\u00a0</span>solution for eliminating acute and chronic pain, accelerating recovery, and restoring natural balance to the body. The Pinnacle Lite harnesses these restorative frequencies to help the body heal itself \u2014 naturally, effectively, and safely.</p>\n<p><span>In this guide, you will discover everything from the most basic protocols up to the most advanced healing techniques\u2014expressly designed by the veteran microcurrent specialists at Pain Free for Life. <strong>E-book now available! <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><em>Paperback format will be available in the near future (formatting is currently under review with our publisher/printing teams).</em></span></strong></span></p>\n<h2><span>Master the Art and Science of Microcurrent Healing </span></h2>\n<p><span>Microcurrent pain therapy is not only a science but an art and knowing how to perform various protocols is essential for successful healing. This manual is your answer to mastering our simple to learn, easy to apply, and highly effective microcurrent solutions. </span></p>\n<h2><span>Achieve Unmatched Treatment Versatility </span></h2>\n<p><span>This newly expanded and refined User's Guide will help you learn the four basic rules of microcurrent that everyone must follow, advanced neurofeedback and biofeedback features, and even how to design and program custom treatment modes to suit your individual needs and goals.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>Books/User Guides are not eligible for return or refund. They cannot be ordered and cancelled prior to fulfillment. All book orders are final sale.</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Enjoy easy to understand protocols for lasting and severe health conditions like:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Anxiety</span></li>\n<li><span>Autoimmune conditions </span></li>\n<li><span>Broken bones </span></li>\n<li><span>Chronic pain</span></li>\n<li><span>Depression </span></li>\n<li><span>Inflammation</span></li>\n<li><span>Injured muscles </span></li>\n<li><span>Insomnia</span></li>\n<li><span>Scars and wounds of all kinds </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>And much more!</span><span></span></p>",
