    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<p><strong>\ud83d\udd04</strong><strong><span>\u00a0</span>Upgrade Your Avazzia Life Genesis or Genesis II to the New Avazzia Life Pinnacle Lite</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Save Money, Reduce Waste, and Unlock the Next Level of Microcurrent Healing</strong></p>\n<p>Take your microcurrent therapy to new heights!<br>For a<span>\u00a0</span><strong>limited time</strong>,<span>\u00a0</span><strong>Avazzia Life Genesis and Genesis II owners</strong><span>\u00a0</span>can<span>\u00a0</span><strong>upgrade to the new Avazzia Life Pinnacle Lite</strong><span>\u00a0</span>\u2014 our most advanced, easy-to-use professional microcurrent device \u2014 and enjoy<span>\u00a0</span><strong>exclusive trade-in savings</strong>.</p>\n<p>\u26a0\ufe0f<span>\u00a0</span><strong>Please note:</strong><span>\u00a0</span>Orders will be fulfilled in the order they are received.</p>\n<p>The<span>\u00a0</span><strong>Avazzia Life Pinnacle Lite</strong><span>\u00a0</span>delivers all the professional-grade healing power you\u2019ve come to trust \u2014 now enhanced with greater precision, more programs, and unmatched simplicity.</p>\n<p><strong>\ud83d\udca1</strong><strong><span>\u00a0</span>How the Upgrade Works</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<strong>Place Your Upgrade Order.</strong><span>\u00a0</span>Purchase the upgrade directly from our store.</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #e06666;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0000;\">We will verify your previous purchase prior to<span>\u00a0</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0000;\">shipping</span><span>\u00a0</span>your Brand-New Pinnacle Lite</span>.</strong><span> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We\u2019ll ship your new device first, so you don't have any downtime with devices.</span></span></span></li>\n<li>\n<strong>Choose Your Return Option:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Option A:</strong><span>\u00a0</span>Send your<span>\u00a0</span><strong>Avazzia Life Genesis or Genesis II</strong><span>\u00a0</span>back within<span>\u00a0</span><strong>30 days</strong><span>\u00a0</span>of receiving your new device (client is responsible for return shipping).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Option B:</strong><span>\u00a0</span>Want to keep both? Simply select the<span>\u00a0</span><strong>\u201cKeep My Genesis\u201d</strong><span>\u00a0</span>option at checkout and pay an additional<span>\u00a0</span><strong>$300 USD</strong><span>\u00a0</span>\u2014 no return required.\u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"color: #cc0000;\"><strong><em>Please note: Upgrade devices are not eligible for returns and we will verify your original device purchase prior to fulfilling this upgrade.</em></strong></span></p>\n<p>\u2705 It\u2019s simple, flexible, and designed with your convenience in mind.</p>\n<p><strong>\ud83c\udf81</strong><strong><span>\u00a0</span>Special Bonus Offer \u2014 90 Days of Free Essentials Membership!</strong></p>\n<p>When you upgrade, you\u2019ll also receive<span>\u00a0</span><strong>90 days of free Essentials Membership Access</strong><span>\u00a0</span>to the<span>\u00a0</span><strong>Hache Protocol Online Training Community</strong><span>\u00a0</span>(a $150 value).</p>\n<p>This exclusive membership gives you access to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Expert-led video training on microcurrent and pain resolution</li>\n<li>Step-by-step guidance for using your new Pinnacle Lite</li>\n<li>Support from our team and microcurrent user community</li>\n<li>Proven methods to maximize results and master your device faster</li>\n</ul>\n<p>It\u2019s our way of saying thank you for being part of the Pain Free For Life community \u2014 and for investing in your next level of healing.</p>\n<p><strong>\u26a1</strong><strong><span>\u00a0</span>Why Upgrade to the Avazzia Life Pinnacle Lite?</strong></p>\n<p>The<span>\u00a0</span><strong>Pinnacle Lite</strong><span>\u00a0</span>builds on the success of the Genesis and Genesis II with next-generation performance and features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>16 pre-set therapy programs</strong><span>\u00a0</span>crafted by the doctors at Pain Free For Life</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom frequency design</strong><span>\u00a0</span>from<span>\u00a0</span><strong>0.5 Hz \u2013 1563 Hz</strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Enhanced power and precision</strong><span>\u00a0</span>for acute, chronic, and complex conditions</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Professional-level results</strong><span>\u00a0</span>with an easy, intuitive interface</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>\ud83c\udf1f</strong><strong><span>\u00a0</span>What Makes the Pinnacle Lite Special</strong></p>\n<p>The Pinnacle Lite incorporates the same<span>\u00a0</span><strong>proprietary blended therapy programs</strong><span>\u00a0</span>found in the flagship<span>\u00a0</span><strong>Avazzia Life Pinnacle</strong>, designed to work seamlessly with the<span>\u00a0</span><strong>Hache Protocol for Pain Resolution\u2122</strong><span>\u00a0</span>\u2014 the gold standard for natural pain relief and healing.</p>\n<p>Each program is precision-engineered to address:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Chronic &amp; Acute Pain</li>\n<li>Deep Scarring</li>\n<li>Joint Stiffness &amp; Arthritis</li>\n<li>Muscle Weakness &amp; Recovery</li>\n<li>Nerve Issues</li>\n<li>New Trauma Healing</li>\n<li>Soft Tissue Repair</li>\n<li>\u2026and much more</li>\n</ul>\n<p>And the best part?<span>\u00a0</span><strong>No learning curve.</strong><br>Simply select your program and let the device guide you \u2014 effortlessly and effectively.</p>\n<p><strong>\ud83c\udf31</strong><strong><span>\u00a0</span>Upgrade Benefits at a Glance</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Exclusive trade-in savings</strong><span>\u00a0</span>for Genesis and Genesis II owners</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Receive your new device first</strong><span>\u00a0</span>\u2014 no downtime between treatments</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Option to keep both devices</strong><span>\u00a0</span>for an additional\u00a0<strong>$300 USD</strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>90 days of free Essentials Membership access</strong><span>\u00a0</span>(Value $150)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Eco-friendly upgrade program</strong><span>\u00a0</span>reduces electronic waste</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Professional-grade performance</strong><span>\u00a0</span>for home and clinic use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">All Avazzia Life Devices must be powered by 2 high quality 1.5V AA Alkaline batteries (rechargeable-type batteries are not recommended and may negatively impact performance and void the device warranty).</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>\ud83d\udee0</strong><strong><span>\u00a0</span>Ready to Upgrade?</strong></p>\n<p>Upgrading is quick and easy \u2014 just<span>\u00a0</span><strong>place your order today</strong><span>\u00a0</span>to reserve your Pinnacle Lite upgrade. Now shipping!</p>\n<p>If you\u2019re unsure whether the Pinnacle Lite is right for you, call us at<span>\u00a0</span><strong>1-888-758-0851</strong>. Our knowledgeable microcurrent team will help you decide which device best fits your goals and healing journey.</p>",
