    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">At Pain Free For Life, we believe that food is medicine \u2014</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">and that what you eat can be your strongest ally in the</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">fight against inflammation and chronic pain.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">The holidays are a time for connection, warmth, and</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">celebration. Unfortunately, they often bring foods high in</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">sugar, processed fats, and inflammatory ingredients that</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">can trigger pain flare-ups.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">This complimentary (free) collection was created to help you enjoy your favorite</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">holiday flavors while honoring your body\u2019s natural healing</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">systems. Each recipe features whole, anti-inflammatory</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">ingredients that promote balance, vitality, and lasting</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">wellness.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong>Let this season be a celebration of nourishment \u2014 where</strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong>every dish supports your journey toward a pain-free life.</strong></p>",
