    "shortDescription": "Navigate the Avazzia Life Genesis II Microcurrent Device with Confidence and Clarity The Genesis II Official User\u2019s Guide is your key to confidently unlocking t...",
    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h2 style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; page-break-after: auto; margin: 12.0pt 0in 2.0pt 0in;\"><span lang=\"EN\">Navigate the Avazzia Life Genesis II Microcurrent Device with Confidence and Clarity</span></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;\"><span lang=\"EN\">The <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Genesis II Official User\u2019s Guide</b> is your key to confidently unlocking the full healing potential of microcurrent therapy using the Avazzia Life Genesis II at home or in the clinic.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;\"><span lang=\"EN\">Whether you're struggling with tight muscles, stubborn inflammation, stress, sleep challenges, or chronic pain, this beautifully illustrated guide walks you through each step with clarity and compassion.</span></p>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><hr size=\"0\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; page-break-after: auto; margin: 12.0pt 0in 2.0pt 0in;\">\n<a name=\"_cjds8sqjdkhu\"></a><span lang=\"EN\">What\u2019s Inside:</span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 12.0pt 0in .0001pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">\u2714<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN\">Tips on powering on your device, selecting therapies, and choosing the right accessories\u2014even before your first session.<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!--[endif]--></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">\u2714<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN\">Guided instructions on how to locate and clear the hidden hotspots of tension and imbalance that often resist recovery.<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!--[endif]--></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">\u2714<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN\">Techniques designed to help you relax your nervous system, calm inflammation, support regeneration, and restore restful sleep.<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!--[endif]--></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">\u2714<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN\">Step-by-step healing applications, all presented in an easy-to-follow format with supportive visuals\u2014you\u2019ll never feel lost or overwhelmed.<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><!--[endif]--></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;\"><span lang=\"EN\">Your Avazzia Life Genesis II is already a powerful tool. With this guide, it becomes something more\u2014a trusted companion in your journey back to vibrancy, vitality, and truly pain-free living.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return/cancellation.</strong></span></p>",
