    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>The <em>Exclusive</em> Pain Free For Life Thumb Electrode</b></h1>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>What\u2019s it for?</b></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">If you're using microcurrent therapy to treat patients or yourself, this electrode may be the best thing you\u2019ve ever used.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">With a singular contact point the size of your thumb, this electrode can be considered a larger pencil electrode, or a single-balled version of the popular Y Electrode.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Used for cosmetic treatments, trigger point treatments, acupuncture therapy, and even painting \u2013 while maintaining the ability to apply pressure as needed \u2013 this tool is an excellent addition to your toolbox.</p>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Updated design as of August 2026!</b></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">We are happy to offer you a refreshed design of one of our most popular and versatile accessories!\u00a0</p>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>SANA Shop Exclusive Accessory</b></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">As with our SANA Shop exclusive accessories, we cover manufacturer faults on this product for up to a year after receipt of the product. If you have any issues, reach out to <a href=\"mailto:support@painfreeforlife.com\">support@painfreeforlife.com</a> and we will replace it, or fix it.</p>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Requirements</b></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Thumb Electrode requires connection to any of our <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/microcurrent-therapy\">Avazzia Life devices</a>, using our standard lead wire (the same one used for the Y Probe or Pencil Electrode). Available for purchase\u00a0<a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/lead-4-pin-to-2-5-mm-standard-plus?_pos=1&amp;_psq=lead+wire&amp;_ss=e&amp;_v=1.0&amp;variant=7135418908716\">by clicking here</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
