    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1>\n<strong>Microcurrent Goggles Accessory (New Style)</strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong></strong></span>\n</h1>\n<h2>The 21st Century\u2019s Best-Kept Secret to Eye Health</h2>\n<p><span>Our Microcurrent Goggles deliver healing frequencies directly to the eyes without any pain or discomfort. Treatment of the eyes has never been more comfortable, effective, or fast! </span></p>\n<h2>How Do Microcurrent Goggles Work?</h2>\n<p>Microcurrent Goggles are specially designed to safely target critical reflex points around the eye and deliver gentle microcurrent pulses into the eye itself to encourage natural healing of this sensitive tissue. <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 128, 0);\"><strong>These must be used with a an <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/microcurrent-therapy\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 128, 0);\">Avazzia Life device</a> in order to function.</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>The result? Optimum cellular function of your eyes. </strong></p>\n<h2><span>Relief from Difficult to Treat Eye Conditions</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span>Microcurrent Goggles successfully treat an array of vision issues, including:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Scar Tissue</li>\n<li>Eye Fatigue</li>\n<li>Eye Spasms</li>\n<li>Myopia</li>\n<li>Amblyopia</li>\n<li>Astigmatism</li>\n<li>Age-Related Macular Degeneration**</li>\n<li>Cataracts</li>\n<li>Acute Glaucoma</li>\n<li>Subconjunctival Hemorrhage</li>\n<li>Acute Retinal Detachment</li>\n<li>Injuries of Eyes and Periorbital Area</li>\n<li>Presbyopia</li>\n<li>Uveitis</li>\n<li><em>And more! </em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>\u00a0</em></p>\n<h2>The Beauty of Microcurrent Goggles:</h2>\n<p><strong><span>Microcurrent Goggles address not only the symptoms of your vision condition but the underlying cause for long-term resolution.</span></strong></p>\n<h2><span>Fast, Effective, and Comfortable Microcurrent Eye Treatment </span></h2>\n<p><span>Many of our patients report feeling <strong>improvement in their vision after just one session</strong> of microcurrent eye therapy! </span></p>\n<p><span>To read one the <em>many </em>stories about how microcurrent goggles are changing the lives of our patients, </span><a href=\"https://painfreeforlife.com/microcurrent-case-study-rykers-vision-for-success/\"><span>read our case study here</span></a><span>.\u00a0</span><span></span></p>\n<h2><span>Bonus\u2014FREE Gifts</span></h2>\n<p><span>With every Microcurrent Goggles purchase, you will receive:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>A <strong>FREE lead wire </strong>for your microcurrent device.</span></li>\n<li>\n<span>A <strong>FREE</strong>\u00a0e-book copy of our ground-breaking book, </span><a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/the-secrets-of-eye-health-microcurrent-therapy-for-the-eyes\"><span>Secrets of Eye Health</span></a><span>, which has detailed protocols for the above conditions.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>Envision the Possibilities</span></h2>\n<p><span>What if your vision problems were no longer an issue? With microcurrent goggles\u00ad, your dream can finally become a reality. Try Microcurrent Goggles today and enjoy the beauty of the world around you for years to come. </span></p>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Requirements</b></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The microcurrent goggles requires connection to any of our <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/microcurrent-therapy\">Avazzia Life devices</a>, using our standard lead wire (the same one used for the Y Probe or Pencil Electrode). Replacement lead wires are available for purchase <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/lead-4-pin-to-2-5-mm-standard-plus?_pos=1&amp;_psq=lead+wire&amp;_ss=e&amp;_v=1.0&amp;variant=7135418908716\">by clicking here</a>.\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>**Not recommended for use with <em>Wet</em> Macular Degeneration without specific supplementations.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>***Treatment of the eyes with microcurrent is <em>NOT</em> FDA approved or Health Canada Approved. Any use of these goggles is considered an \"off-label\" treatment.</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>Item is not eligible for return if used. <meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
