    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><span>Rectal (Prostate) Attachment</span></h1>\n<p>The Rectal Attachment comfortably and cost effectively treats conditions and concerns related to the anal sphincter and prostate. This small insertable accessory works to gently <span>address an array of health concerns that affect men and women alike.</span></p>\n<p><span>Length:\u00a04 inch\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span>Diameter: 3/4\u00a0inch.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>\n<h2><span>Benefits of the Rectal Attachment </span></h2>\n<p><span>The Rectal Attachment delivers gentle microcurrent pulses internally to<strong>:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strengthen the anal sphincter</li>\n<li>Treat incontinence</li>\n<li>Provide relief from pain and bruising</li>\n<li>Reduce pain and inflammation of the prostate</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://painfreeforlife.com/natural-prostatitis-treatment-what-every-man-should-know/\">Treat an array of prostate issues</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>Alternative to Internal Treatment</span></h2>\n<p>An alternative to internal treatment is the\u00a0<a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/qiwave-12-x-18\">6\"x12\" QiWave PEMF pad</a>. The use of this pad has been proven to be equally effective at reaching the prostate area and reducing inflammation from outside the body.</p>\n<h2><span>Don\u2019t Forget These Additions: </span></h2>\n<p>This accessory requires a\u00a0Red/Black lead wire.\u00a0If your device does not include one, you can purchase it <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">here</a>.</p>\n<p>We highly recommend using this attachment with\u00a0<a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/spectra-gel\">Spectra Gel</a>\u00a0for maximum conductivity and comfort.\u00a0</p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><strong>Dimensions: </strong></em></span>3 inches in total length, from the flange. Diameter is less than 1 inch.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
