    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><strong><span>Upgrade Your Pro Sport III to an Avazzia Life Pinnacle</span></strong></h1>\n<p><span>Upgrade your Avazzia Pro Sport III to the new Avazzia Life Pinnacle to take advantage of our exclusive trade-in offer today.</span></p>\n<p><span>The Avazzia Life Pinnacle is changing the game regarding professional-grade microcurrent treatment by making it simpler than ever before. At any time, over the lifetime of owning your Avazzia Pro Sport III, we invite you to take advantage of our exclusive upgrade offer to the easiest to use professional device on the market:</span></p>\n<p><span>Upgrade a Pro Sport III and get a brand new Avazzia Life Pinnacle!* <em><strong>Only eligible for Pro-Sport devices purchased from Pain Free For Life/The Sana Shop.</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span>Upgrade from the Avazzia Life Pro-Sport</span><span><span>\u00a0</span>to the Avazzia Life Pinnacle.<span>\u00a0</span></span>Simply pay for your upgrade and send in your device to our trusted manufacturer (following our instructions).<em><strong>\u00a0<meta charset=\"utf-8\">Please note: Client is responsible for shipping fees.\u00a0<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\">UPGRADES ARE NOT ELIGIBLE FOR RETURNS.</span></strong></em></p>\n<p><span>Save money, save the environment, and up-level your microcurrent repertoire by upgrading today!</span></p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">All Avazzia Life Devices must be powered by 2 high quality 1.5V AA Alkaline batteries (rechargeable-type batteries are not recommended and may negatively impact performance and void the device warranty).</span></strong></span></p>\n<h2><span>Why Should You Upgrade to the Avazzia Life Pinnacle? \u00a0</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Avazzia Life Pinnacle offers a professional experience with all the features and treatments you\u2019ve come to love in the Pro Sport III without any of the guesswork. With twelve brand new custom programs including new frequencies based on decades of research, the ability to create and store your own custom programs, and over 50 preset programs, the Avazzia Life Pinnacle can treat even the most complicated health issues with remarkable ease \u2013 at home or in a medical setting.</span></p>\n<h2><span>What Makes the Avazzia Life Pinnacle Better than ANY Other Professional-Grade Microcurrent Device? </span></h2>\n<p><span>The Avazzia Life Pinnacle features twelve new custom programs designed by the doctors at Pain Free For Life. These programs utilize blended therapies designed with precision to work with the Hache Protocol for Pain Resolution\u2122, our proprietary program for optimum healing and wellness.<br><br></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Each new program has been expertly designed to work on a specific issue, including: </span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Chronic and Acute Pain</span></li>\n<li><span>Deep and Lasting Scarring </span></li>\n<li><span>Joint Pain</span></li>\n<li><span>Muscle Issues</span></li>\n<li><span>Nerve Troubles</span></li>\n<li><span>New Trauma</span></li>\n<li><span>Soft Tissue</span></li>\n<li><span>And more! </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>And the best part? There\u2019s no learning curve!</span></p>\n<p><span>Don\u2019t wait to take your microcurrent healing to the next level. We can\u2019t wait to see the progress that you accomplish as you and your patients move through your healing journey! </span></p>\n<p><span>Please reach out to our knowledgeable and compassionate staff toll-free at 1-888-758-0851, should you have any questions about upgrading your device.</span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
