    "shortDescription": "THE MASSAGER ELECTRODE UNMATCHED CONTROL\u2014POWERFUL RESULTS The Massager Electrode has been specially designed to work with any microcurrent device in the Avazzia...",
    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<p><strong>THE MASSAGER ELECTRODE</strong></p>\n<p>UNMATCHED CONTROL\u2014POWERFUL RESULTS<br></p>\n<p>The Massager Electrode has been specially designed to work with any microcurrent device in the Avazzia line and to provide full and total control when applying pressure and doing body work.</p>\n<p><strong>The Massager Electrode brings the power back to the palm of the user\u2019s hand, allowing unparalleled control of pressure and excellent coverage of the body. User\u2019s will enjoy:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved self-treatment options with the rounded design allowing for treatment of all areas of the body.</li>\n<li>Better surface coverage for Respiratory Protocols and larger area treatments such as the back, arms, and legs.</li>\n<li>The ability to combine massage level pressure with the palm of your hand while also benefiting from microcurrent.</li>\n<li><em>And much, much, more.</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Try the Massager Electrode today and enjoy the easiest to use, most convenient, and most versatile microcurrent accessory you've ever experienced.</p>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>SANA Shop Exclusive Accessory</b></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">As with our SANA Shop exclusive accessories, we cover manufacturer faults on this product for up to a year after receipt of the product. If you have any issues, reach out to <a href=\"mailto:support@painfreeforlife.com\">support@painfreeforlife.com</a> and we will replace it, or fix it.</p>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Requirements</b></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Massager Electrode requires connection to any of our <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/microcurrent-therapy\">Avazzia Life devices</a>, using our standard lead wire (the same one used for the Y Probe or Pencil Electrode).\u00a0<strong>Please select whether you need a wire or not for your electrode purchase. </strong>Replacement lead wires are available for purchase\u00a0<a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/lead-4-pin-to-2-5-mm-standard-plus?_pos=1&amp;_psq=lead+wire&amp;_ss=e&amp;_v=1.0&amp;variant=7135418908716\">by clicking here</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
