    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><strong><span>Current Medicine 3rd Edition - Available Now!</span></strong></h1>\n<p><em><span>Current Medicine 2<sup>nd</sup> Edition</span></em><span> has been a perennial resource for countless microcurrent novices and masters alike all over the world. In fact, it made mastering microcurrent therapy more straightforward, simple, and effective for everyone \u2013 whether they had a medical background or not. </span></p>\n<p><span>Because science is constantly evolving, and so are we, we thought it was finally time to expand upon and improve <em>Current Medicine</em> to reflect the most recent advancements in microcurrent technology that have come to light. The Result? <em>Current Medicine 3<sup>rd</sup> Edition</em>. </span></p>\n<p><span>Writing the third edition of this book was not something we undertook lightly. Our goal was to offer a new and innovative experience and approach to the life-changing power of microcurrent therapy and energy medicine. As such, <em>Current Medicine 3<sup>rd</sup> Edition</em> explains each protocol in-depth, brings new and progressive technology to the forefront, names specific programs to use rather than just focusing on frequencies, and showcases beautifully enhanced graphics, each carefully constructed by our in-house team of experts. </span></p>\n<p><span>The result is an all-encompassing guidebook for anyone wishing to maximize the potential of any microcurrent device \u2013 with a particular focus on those in the Avazzia line. </span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Exciting Additions to <em>Current Medicine 3<sup>rd</sup> Edition</em> Include:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Sensational New Protocols</span></li>\n<li><span>Improvements to protocols in keeping with recent scientific developments</span></li>\n<li><span>New and improved high-quality images to be used as a reference</span></li>\n<li>\n<span>Succinct descriptions of conditions, with a laser focus on the\u00a0</span>treatments</li>\n<li><span>Specific frequencies <em>and </em>specialized mode names </span></li>\n<li><span>Scalar Energy Healing Protocols</span></li>\n<li><span>Pulsed Electromagnetic Field (PEMF) Protocols</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span>New Protocols! Including:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>PTSD </span></li>\n<li><span>Mitochondrial Recharge </span></li>\n<li><span>Full Immune Enhancement</span></li>\n<li><span>Peyronie's Disease</span></li>\n<li><span>Thyroid Discharge</span></li>\n<li><span>Hypothyroidism</span></li>\n<li><span>Hyperthyroidism</span></li>\n<li><span>Ulcerative Colitis</span></li>\n<li><span>Full Scalar Energy Protocols</span></li>\n<li><span>PEMF Protocols</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>Current Medicine 3<sup>rd</sup> Edition is an illustrated encyclopedic collection of over 100 microcurrent protocols</span><span> and how to apply them to your everyday life\u2014a must-have for any home user or microcurrent practitioner's collection. </span></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>Books/User Guides are not eligible for return or refund. They cannot be ordered and cancelled prior to fulfillment. All book orders are final sale.</strong></span>\u00a0<br></p>",
