    "shortDescription": "This fully illustrated user's guide is the most up-to-date instruction on the Avazzia Life Pinnacle technology available today\u2014 now available in eBook and paper...",
    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">This fully illustrated user's guide is the most up-to-date instruction on the Avazzia\u00a0Life Pinnacle\u00a0technology available today\u2014<em data-mce-fragment=\"1\">now available in eBook and paperback format.</em><br></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The Avazzia Life Pinnacle\u00a0is the new KING of microcurrent devices used by thousands of professionals and home users worldwide. </span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">With the assistance of this simplified and comprehensive user's guide, you too can achieve effective relief from chronic pain, inflammation, and so much more! </span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">In this guide, you will discover everything from the most basic protocols up to the most advanced healing techniques\u2014expressly designed by the veteran microcurrent specialists at Pain Free for Life.</span></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Master the Art and Science of Microcurrent Healing </span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Microcurrent pain therapy is not only a science but an art and knowing how to perform various protocols is essential for successful healing. This manual is your answer to mastering our simple to learn, easy to apply, and highly effective microcurrent solutions. </span></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Achieve Unmatched Treatment Versatility </span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">This newly expanded and refined User's Guide will help you learn the four basic rules of microcurrent that everyone must follow, advanced neurofeedback and biofeedback features, and even how to design and program custom treatment modes to suit your individual needs and goals. </span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">It will also explain all about the differences between the Pro-Sport 3 and the new Avazzia Life Pinnacle to make use of the Pinnacle's new custom automatic smart-modes, that take care of most problems seamlessly, and easily.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Enjoy easy to understand protocols for lasting and severe health conditions like:</span></strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Anxiety</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Autoimmune conditions </span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Broken bones </span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Chronic pain</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Depression </span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Inflammation</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Injured muscles </span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Insomnia</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Scars and wounds of all kinds </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">And much more!</span></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Unlock Your Healing Potential Today </span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><em data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Are you ready to tackle the body's most challenging conditions\u2014at home or in a medical setting\u2014without invasive procedures, needles, surgeries, or long recovery periods?</span></em></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">If so, the Avazzia Life Pinnacle User's Guide and Protocol Guidebook\u00a0</span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">is an invaluable resource that should be added to your collection right away.</span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\u00a0<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>",
