    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><strong><span>UPGRADE YOUR AVAZZIA LIFE GENESIS\u00a0TO AN AVAZZIA LIFE PINNACLE AND SAVE (LIMITED TIME OFFER)</span></strong></h1>\n<p><span>Upgrade your Avazzia\u00a0Life Genesis to the new Avazzia Life Pinnacle to take advantage of our exclusive trade-in offer today.</span></p>\n<p><span>The Avazzia Life Pinnacle is changing the game regarding professional-grade microcurrent treatment by making it simpler than ever before. At any time, over the lifetime of owning your Avazzia Life Genesis, we invite you to take advantage of our exclusive upgrade offer to the easiest to use professional device on the market:</span></p>\n<p><span>Upgrade an Avazzia Life Genesis and get a brand new Avazzia Life Pinnacle:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<span>Upgrade from the\u00a0Avazzia Life Genesis</span><span> to the Avazzia Life Pinnacle. </span>Simply pay for your upgrade and send in your device (following our instructions).\u00a0<em style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"><strong>We will send you a brand new Avazzia Life Pinnacle device - standalone device only, no accessories are included in this fee. <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <em>Please note: Client is responsible for shipping their original device back within 30 days of receiving the new device, and are responsible for shipping fees.</em></strong></em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>Save money, save the environment, and up-level your microcurrent repertoire by upgrading today!</span></p>\n<h2><span>WHY SHOULD YOU UPGRADE TO THE AVAZZIA LIFE PINNACLE? \u00a0</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Avazzia Life Pinnacle offers a professional experience with all the features and treatments you\u2019ve come to love in the\u00a0Life Genesis AND MORE. With twelve brand new custom programs including new frequencies based on decades of research, the ability to create and store your own custom programs, and over 50 preset programs, the Avazzia Life Pinnacle can treat even the most complicated health issues with remarkable ease \u2013 at home or in a medical setting.</span></p>\n<h2><span>WHAT MAKES THE AVAZZIA LIFE PINNACLE BETTER THAN ANY OTHER PROFESSIONAL-GRADE MICROCURRENT DEVICE?</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Avazzia Life Pinnacle features twelve\u00a0new custom programs designed by the doctors at Pain Free For Life. These programs utilize blended therapies designed with precision to work with the Hache Protocol for Pain Resolution\u2122, our proprietary program for optimum healing and wellness.<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">All Avazzia Life Devices must be powered by 2 high quality 1.5V AA Alkaline batteries (rechargeable-type batteries are not recommended and may negatively impact performance and void the device warranty).</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Each new program has been expertly designed to work on a specific issue, including:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Chronic and Acute Pain</span></li>\n<li><span>Deep and Lasting Scarring</span></li>\n<li><span>Joint Pain</span></li>\n<li><span>Muscle Issues</span></li>\n<li><span>Nerve Troubles</span></li>\n<li><span>New Trauma</span></li>\n<li><span>Soft Tissue</span></li>\n<li><span>And more!</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>And the best part? There\u2019s no learning curve!</span></p>\n<p><span>We are offering this trade-in deal in an ongoing capacity - you can upgrade at any time.</span></p>\n<p><span> Don\u2019t wait to take your microcurrent healing to the next level. We can\u2019t wait to see the progress that you accomplish as you and your patients move through your healing journey!</span></p>\n<h2><span>UPGRADING IS AS SIMPLE AS A PHONE CALL</span></h2>\n<p><span>When it\u2019s time to make professional microcurrent healing more straightforward and more effective than you ever imagined, please reach out to our knowledgeable and compassionate staff toll-free at 1-888-758-0851 to start the upgrade process. \u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span>If you\u2019re not sure if the Avazzia Life Pinnacle is for you, just give us a call, and we\u2019ll talk you through the details to help you decide which device is best for you and your individual goals.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><em><strong>UPGRADES ARE NOT ELIGIBLE FOR RETURNS.</strong></em></span></span></p>\n<p><span>Thank you!</span></p>",
