    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<p>This 35\u00a0millimeter conductive pad allows for treatment of a specific pain point with a single pad, instead of a pair. This is\u00a0useful for acupuncture points, localized injury and wounds, treatment of children, and particularly for stimulation of the Third Eye with Gamma waves in order to help clear the brain of amyloid plaque.</p>\n<p>Third Eye Stimulation\u00a0is an effective method for treatment of:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Anxiety</li>\n<li>Mental Fatigue</li>\n<li>Brain Fog and Poor Memory</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please note that in order to effectively use this pad for Third Eye stimulation you will need an <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-life-evolution\" target=\"_blank\">Avazzia Life Evolution</a>, or a <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-pro-sport-iii-device-only\" target=\"_blank\">Pro-Sport 3</a>, with the appropriate Gamma programs.</p>\n<p>This pad requires a <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\" target=\"_blank\">R/B Leadwire</a> to connect to your Avazzia device.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
