    "shortDescription": "The Sana Health Blanket Large Blanket Dimensions: Approximately 82\" x 86\", slight variations in measurements can occur due to these being hand-crafted creations...",
    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><span>The Sana Health Blanket</span></h1>\n<h3><span>Large Blanket Dimensions: Approximately 82\" x 86\", slight variations in measurements can occur due to these being hand-crafted creations. Patterns vs solid will vary based on fabrics available!</span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>Important notes:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>The product is Dry Clean or hand-wash/hang-dry only.\u00a0We strongly recommend the use of a duvet cover to protect your new blanket!</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><b>Blankets are made to order, with a current creation time of up to three months during high-demand order seasons or sales.</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><b>No order cancellations or alterations to your order are permitted once the order is submitted, due to the item being custom-made, just for you!</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><b>If you live in the USA, you may be responsible for customs fees for blankets. We do not determine, collect or interact with US-based customs fees.</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><b style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Previously known as \"King Size\".</b></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>WAKE UP HEALTHIER EVERY MORNING BY REVOLUTIONIZING THE WAY YOU SLEEP</span></h2>\n<p><span>Experience a unique way to enhance your sleep routine with the Sana Health Blanket. Designed with comfort and health in mind, this blanket aims to offer a more restful night's sleep.</span></p>\n<h2><span>HOW DOES THE SANA HEALTH BLANKET WORK?</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Sana Health blanket\u2019s healing capabilities are rooted in extensive research conducted by the Russian Space Program. Scientists sought to diminish stress on the body and mind of cosmonauts while increasing their vital energy. This research led to the usage of reflective material in their spacesuits similar to what is used in the Sana Healing Blanket.</span></p>\n<p><span>The Sana Health Blanket reflects your body\u2019s natural radiation back towards you while you sleep. This magnifies your body\u2019s \u201cenergetic portrait,\u201d by potentially restoring and rebalancing the harmony of its inherent energy flow.</span></p>\n<h2><span>MAXIMIZE THE HEALING POTENTIAL OF YOUR SLEEP WITH THESE BENEFITS</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Sana Health Blanket is not just a powerful way to promote healing and vitality. The additional benefits are almost endless!</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Enjoy these benefits with your Sana Health Blanket</span></strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Comfort Focused: </span></strong><span>Designed to offer a cozy, comfy sleeping experience. Medium-Heavyweight natural materials are used in the creation process. *Designs and patterns may vary.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Inspired by Space Technology:</span></strong><span> Utilizes reflective materials similar to those found in astronaut suits.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Versatile Use:</span></strong><span> Ideal for relaxation at home, during travel, or as part of your wellness routine.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Aesthetically Pleasing: </span></strong><span>Available in various patterns and colors to suit your style.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Ease of Use: </span></strong><span>Simple to use and no setup required.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Environmental Consideration:</span></strong><span> Does not require electricity, making it an eco-friendly option.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Durability and Portability: </span></strong><span>Built to last and easy to take with you on the go.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>WHO SHOULD USE THE SANA HEALTH BLANKET?</span></h2>\n<p><span>Everybody! The Sana Health Blanket comes in small, standard and large sizes. A therapeutic blanket is especially appreciated by anyone who has recently experienced illness, surgery, trauma, or high levels of stress and anxiety.</span></p>\n<h2><span>EASY USE- ANYWHERE, ANY TIME</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Sana Health Blanket is extremely convenient to use! Drape this therapy blanket over you while you are watching your favorite show, working from home or the office, doing crafts, resting, or sleeping.</span></p>\n<p><span>The Sana Health Blanket can be used almost anywhere! At home, traveling, or even in a clinical or spa setting.</span></p>\n<h2><span>BLANKET YOUR FAMILY IN HEALTH AND PROTECTION TODAY</span></h2>\n<p><span>Try the Sana Health Blanket today to secure lasting health and vitality for your entire family. Once you\u2019ve cocooned yourself in the soothing and healing comfort of this therapeutic blanket, you\u2019ll never look back.</span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Please note: Each blanket is handcrafted, so please allow extra time for the creation process. We will ship your blanket as soon as possible.</strong></span></span></p>",
