    "shortDescription": "Pro Features, Affordable Price. Now, There\u2019s No Reason Not to Have the Best Pain Relief Microcurrent Has to Offer Created specifically to meet Pain Free for Lif...",
    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ndGV9uxgv3U\"></iframe></h3>\n<h2>Pro Features, Affordable Price.</h2>\n<h2>Now, There\u2019s No Reason Not to Have the Best Pain Relief Microcurrent Has to Offer</h2>\n<p>Created specifically to meet Pain Free for Life\u2019s exacting standards, The Avazzia Life Evolution delivers maximum functionality and ease of use for the home user. We worked closely with Avazzia to develop this at-home microcurrent device. With over two decades of expertise in microcurrent technology and clinical applications, we can say with confidence that it is the best home microcurrent machine on the market today.</p>\n<h2>What Makes the Avazzia Life Evolution Better than ANY Other At-Home Microcurrent Machine?</h2>\n<p>The Evolution represents a quantum leap beyond previous generations of home use microcurrent machines. It treats a wider variety of pain conditions than previous models and is capable of executing more of the core protocols within our curriculum than comparable models. In addition, it is an efficient Biofeedback/Neurofeedback device thanks to the reactions technology within it. Combined with the Hache Protocol for Pain Resolution, we are able to offer a highly effective and cost efficient protocol for popular applications such as improving sleep, reducing inflammation body-wide, and even for relief of anxiety and depression \u2013 all with our simple to use protocols.</p>\n<p>The Evolution is the best performing home microcurrent machine available today for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vagus Nerve Stimulation**</strong> \u2013 Systemic anti-inflammatory treatment through the Vagus Nerve is a safe neurofeedback technique capable of flipping the switch on pain. At approximately half the price of the next closest device featuring the appropriate algorithm for this treatment, the Evolution is hands-down the most cost-effective microcurrent machine for the purpose.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Systemic Neurofeedback**</strong> \u2013 The Evolution provides the appropriate frequencies to support protocols for sleep enhancement, stress reduction, and treating symptoms of mental health concerns\u00a0through simple neurofeedback protocols.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Scar Tissue</strong> \u2013 Electrical scar build-up can have a profound negative effect on our body. Not only can the Evolution cause visible scars to fade like cosmetic microcurrent can, but it can be used to restore electrical potential to the skin and restore neural communication pathways throughout the body.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anti-Inflammatory programs:</strong> The Avazzia Life Evolution microcurrent device features a collection of anti-inflammatory frequency sets to ensure that pain can be tackled simply and effectively.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Stimulation algorithms:</strong> Capable of stimulating acupuncture points for non-invasive health benefits as used by acupuncturists.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Biofeedback capabilities:</strong> In the case of particularly stubborn health concerns, treatment can be enhanced through feedback given by the device to facilitate connection between the body and the microcurrent machine. \u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Shuts Down Chronic Pain Like Never Before</h2>\n<p>Good news if you are suffering from chronic pain or repetitive stress injuries. The Evolution is the\u00a0first microcurrent device on the market to feature <strong>FM RSI frequencies</strong>\u2013 an enhanced algorithm.</p>\n<p>Designed specifically for repetitive stress injuries and chronic pain, these frequencies are associated with reducing fluid retention in joints as well. They are uniquely capable of shutting down chronic pain and tense muscle problems\u2014a huge aid for any arthritic condition or chronic inflammation of any kind.</p>\n<h2>More Than Just Microcurrent</h2>\n<p>Capable of accepting all accessories on TheSanaShop.com, the Evolution allows the device to turn from microcurrent, to a pulsed electromagnetic field, to a Scalar Wave generator, and more \u2013 all within seconds, making it a highly versatile unit that can be used to safely and easily relieve dozens of common conditions at home.</p>\n<h2>Approved by Health Care Regulatory Agencies Worldwide</h2>\n<p>All medical devices are subject to stringent regulation by national and intergovernmental agencies.\u00a0 The approval process may include proof of efficacy, quality control, registration of manufacturers and distributors, labeling approval, and/or other rigorous requirements. The Avazzia Life Evolution is:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>FDA Cleared</strong> for sale in the United States</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Health Canada\u00a0Licensed\u00a0</strong>in Canada</li>\n<li>\n<strong>CE certified</strong> to conform with health, safety, and environmental protection standards for products sold within the European Economic Area (EEA)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>TGA Approved</strong> for sale in Australia</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">All Avazzia Life Devices must be powered by 2 high quality 1.5V AA Alkaline batteries (rechargeable-type batteries are not recommended and may negatively impact performance and void the device warranty).</span></strong></p>\n<h2>\n<strong>BONUS: </strong><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN\">Personal Treatment Coordinator with 90-days Trial Membership to the Renowned <a href=\"https://www.painfreelivinglab.com/hache-protocol-private-membership\">Hache Protocol Private Membership</a></span></b>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\">Benefit from over 30 years of innovation in microcurrent therapy with our proprietary Avazzia Life Evolution device. Each device comes paired with a <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">personal treatment coordinator</b> to create a treatment plan perfectly suited to your needs. This service is yours to try for 90-days for only $1 setup fee!</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\">Log into the Hache Protocol Private Membership library 24/7 to view 400+ protocol and demonstration videos from the comfort of your home, day or night! This membership offers clear and simple guidance in microcurrent therapy, helping you master your Evolution device and optimize your results.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\">But it gets even better: After 3 months, extend your membership and enjoy a lower monthly fee so you can make the most out of your wellness experience with us!</span></p>\n<h2>Try the Evolution Risk Free for 30 Days</h2>\n<p>The Evolution comes with our 30-Day Moneyback Satisfaction Guarantee*. Try it risk free for the first month!</p>\n<p>We understand that this can seem overwhelming, but it doesn't have to be.<strong>\u00a0<u>Not sure if the Avazzia Life Evolution is right for you?\u00a0</u></strong>Give us a call toll-free at\u00a0<strong>1-888-758-0851</strong>\u00a0and we will walk you through everything that the Avazzia Life Evolution can do for you!</p>\n<p><em>*A 15% restocking fee applies</em></p>\n<p><em>**Please note that Vagus Nerve Stimulation and Neurofeedback therapy is an \"off label\" therapy, and is not approved by regulatory bodies outside of Europe.</em></p>\n<h2><br></h2>",
