    "id": "3934288969772",
    "handle": "2-in-1-air-purifier-and-disinfectant-device",
    "title": "2-in-1 Air Purifier and Disinfectant Device",
    "category": "devices",
    "badge": "",
    "shortDescription": "2-in-1 Air Purification Device Are you tired of compromising the air quality in your living space due to indoor pollutants and contaminants? Look no further! Ou...",
    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">2-in-1 Air Purification Device</span></h1>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Are you tired of compromising the air quality in your living space due to indoor pollutants and contaminants? Look no further! Our 2-in-1 Air Purification Device is here to revolutionize the way you breathe. This innovative machine combines cutting-edge technology with the healing properties of natural salt therapy to create a cleaner, safer, and revitalizing environment within your home.</span></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Advanced High Voltage Technology</span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Our 2-in-1 Air Purification Device utilizes high voltage technology to effectively filter and disinfect the air. The beauty of this system lies in its simplicity\u2014there are no moving parts, ensuring silent and maintenance-free operation. Drawing air inside the unit through its specifically designed electrode settlement, our device's built-in electrode system effectively collects air pollutants, such as dust, pollen, and allergens, removing them from the air you breathe.</span></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Efficient Air Disinfection with Ozone</span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">During operation, our Air Purification Device produces a very small amount of ozone, enhancing its disinfection capabilities. Ozone is a powerful oxidizing agent that neutralizes airborne pathogens, including bacteria and viruses, providing an added layer of protection for you and your loved ones.</span></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Harnessing the Power of Salt Therapy</span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">At the core of our Air Purification Device's effectiveness lies its unique Salt Therapy Filter. Sourced from the prestigious Transylvanian Praid Salt Mine, this filter contains micron-sized salt particles. As the air passes through the Salt Therapy Filter, it absorbs these beneficial salt particles, introducing the natural healing effects of salt therapy. Unlike other devices, our Air Purification Device ensures that it does not blow salt dust into the air, maintaining a clean and dust-free living space.</span></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Innovative Air Purification and Disinfection</span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Our Air Purification Device is a versatile machine that can be adjusted to suit your specific needs. With adjustable operation intensity, it can purify or disinfect the air depending on your preferences and environmental conditions. This 2-in-1 functionality makes it a standout choice, offering you the flexibility to adapt to varying air quality concerns.</span></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A Comprehensive Solution for Cleaner Air</span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Indoor air quality is a growing concern for all of us. <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">According to statistics, the average indoor air can be up to five times more polluted than the air outside.</strong> With our Air Purification Device, you can take control of your living environment and enjoy the following benefits:</span></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Filters the air:</span></strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Our 2-in-1 Air Purification Device efficiently removes airborne particles, such as dust, pollen, pet dander, and other pollutants, ensuring that the air you breathe is cleaner and healthier.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Absorbs impurities from the air:</span></strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> With its electrode settlement system, our device effectively traps and removes impurities, including harmful substances that can negatively impact respiratory health.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Kills bacteria and viruses:</span></strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> The presence of ozone during operation helps neutralize bacteria and viruses, reducing the risk of airborne infections and creating a safer living space.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Generates negative ions:</span></strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Our device's operation generates negative ions, which have been associated with mood enhancement and a sense of well-being, contributing to a more refreshing and invigorating indoor environment.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Blocks odor:</span></strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Unpleasant odors from cooking, pets, or other sources can be a nuisance. Our Air Purification Device tackles these odors, leaving your living space smelling fresh and clean.</span>\u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Compatible Worldwide</h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">We are proud to offer the added convenience of options for both European and North American plugs. We understand that electrical outlets vary in different regions, and offering this flexibility ensures that our device can seamlessly integrate into any home, regardless of location.</span></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Package Contents and Technical Specifications</span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The package of our 2-in-1 Air Purification Device contains the Air Purifier, DC Adapter, Supersaturated Salt Solution, and User Manual. </span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">It boasts a gross weight of 13.89 lb (6.30 kg) and dimensions of 26.18 x 7.09 x 17.72 inches (66.50 x 18.00 x 45.00 cm).</span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Its technical specifications include a size of 23.62 x 5.91 x 16.34 inches (60.00 x 15.00 x 41.50 cm) and a net weight of 12.13 lb (5.50 kg). </span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><em data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Our Air Purification Device is powered by a wall adapter, ensuring low electric consumption and cost-effective operation.</span></em></p>\n<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Experience Clean, Revitalizing Air Once Again! </span></h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Our 2-in-1 Air Purification Device is the perfect choice to elevate your indoor air quality, providing you with a sanctuary of fresh and revitalizing air within the comfort of your own home. So, why wait? </span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Take the proactive step towards cleaner air and healthier life\u2014choose Our 2-in-1 Air Purification Device today.</span></p>",
