    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<p><strong>Available in Paperback/E-book Combo or Printable E-book Version.</strong></p>\n<p>At Pain Free For Life we have always taken patients from all walks of life, and yes, some of them have been animals. Alternative health options exist for humans and they should for pets as well. In this book, Dr. John Hache, Dr. Lorry Hache, and Rob Vanbergen, have collaborated to create a manual that expands into different areas of Alternative Medicine: Homeopathy, Nutrition, Microcurrent Therapy, Traditional Chinese Medicine, Meridian Therapy, and Ayurveda \u2013 all of which is targeted towards animals.</p>\n<p>This manual contains over 100 pages of instruction for animal health, and includes a Homeopathic Guide for pets, Meridian Charts (For Equine, Feline, and Canines), Advice for the ideal equipment for treating your pets, Chakra treatment plans and location diagrams, Success Stories, Nutritional Advice, Step-By-Step Microcurrent Protocols.</p>\n<p>Microcurrent Protocols include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Arthritis</li>\n<li>Founder (Laminitis)</li>\n<li>Pet Vagus Nerve Stimulation</li>\n<li>General Health Protocol</li>\n<li>Cancer</li>\n<li>Dental Issues</li>\n<li>Blindness (Due to Cataracts and Glaucoma)</li>\n<li>Kidney Failure</li>\n<li>Fractures and Wounds</li>\n<li>Anxiety</li>\n</ul>\n<p>And more!</p>\n<p>With this book, your animal companion\u2019s health will be in excellent hands!</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return/cancellation.</strong></span></p>",
