    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h2><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\">Effective November 3, 2025: Due to importing challenges we are no longer able to ship these supplements to anyone based in the United States. If you accidently include these items in your order, we will refund you for the amount paid, minus a 3.5% processing fee.</span></h2>\n<h2><br></h2>\n<h2>This all-on-one supplement has been put together to provide the nutrients needed to feed the eye and maintain optimum health. These supplements can directly inhibit age related eye degeneration, and form the foundation for the resolution of Eye Diseases.\u00a0</h2>\n<p>We've put our experience in helping deal with eye conditions into play and created an all in one eye supplement, with L-Taurine helping to activate the Zeaxanthin and Lutein. Exact ingredients are listed below:</p>\n<p><strong>Ingredients:\u00a0</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Microcrystalline Cellulose 300mg</li>\n<li>Marigold extract (18% Lutein, 1% Zeaxanthan)\u00a0 100mg</li>\n<li>L Taurine USP 30mg</li>\n<li>Zeaxanthin 2mg</li>\n</ul>\n<div data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\" class=\"x_elementToProof\"><em><strong>This supplement includes naturally occurring ingredients and the coloring of the capsules can vary.\u00a0</strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"x_elementToProof\" id=\"x_Signature\">\n<div class=\"x_elementToProof\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Indications</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides antioxidants for the maintenance of eye health.</li>\n<li>Helps to reduce the risk of developing cataracts,.</li>\n<li>Helps to improve macular pigment optical density.</li>\n<li>Helps to support eye-health in conditions such as cataracts (associated with sunlight damage) and age-related macular degeneration.</li>\n<li><strong>Optimizing eyes for improved microcurrent treatment.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Directions</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Adults</strong>: 1 capsules once daily with a meal a few hours before or after taking other medications. Consult a healthcare practitioner if usage is prolonged over 6 weeks.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Caution</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Consult a healthcare practitioner prior to use if you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or taking medications to treat diabetes, high blood pressure, or seizures.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Contraindications</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Do not use if you are taking health products that influence blood clotting as this may increase the risk of spontaneous hemorrhage.</li>\n<li>Do not use if allergic to Asteraceae (daisy family).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>",
