    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h2><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\">Effective November 3, 2025: Due to importing challenges we are no longer able to ship these supplements to anyone based in the United States. If you accidently include these items in your order, we will refund you for the amount paid, minus a 3.5% processing fee.</span></h2>\n<p>Using our combined naturopathic experience, we at The Sana Shop have formulated SANA Curcumin, an essential supplement that fills a need as a very powerful Anti-Inflammatory supplement. Typical Curcumin supplements require 2-3 capsules to reach a power of around 800mg of Curcumin daily, one single capsule of SANA Curcumin delivers the equivalent of over 4500mg of the supplement for astonishing anti-inflammatory effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Indications</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Used in herbal medicine as anti-inflammatory to help relieve joint pain.</li>\n<li>Used in Ayurveda to relieve pain and inflammation.</li>\n<li>Used in Ayurveda to assist healing of minor wounds such as cuts, burns or minor skin irritations.</li>\n<li>Studies have shown Curcumin supplements to have a profound effect on inflammation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Directions</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Adults</strong>: 1 capsule once per day with a meal.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Caution</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Consult a healthcare practitioner before using if you are pregnant or breastfeeding, if you have gallstones or a bile duct obstruction or if you suffer from stomach ulcers or excess stomach acid. Consult a health care practitioner if symptoms persist or worsen.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Quantity: 30\u00a0capsules<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Medicinal ingredient</strong></p>\n<p>Each capsule contains:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Turmeric\u00a0(<em>Curcuma longa - 3 reduct</em>) \u2013 46 mg of pure curcumin<br>equivalent to <em><strong>4620</strong></em>\u00a0<em><strong>mg</strong></em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Non-medicinal ingredients</strong></p>\n<p>Brown Rice Powder - 0.8g<br></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>",
