    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><strong>Conductive Adjustable Neck Wrap </strong></h1>\n<p>Eliminate persistent tension headaches and general neck pain with this hands-free accessory.</p>\n<p>This Conductive Neck Wrap features two electrodes specially designed to comfortably rest on either side of your spine.</p>\n<p><strong>A can't miss accessory in treating the following conditions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tension headaches</li>\n<li>General neck pain</li>\n<li>\"Texting neck\"</li>\n<li>Muscle strains</li>\n<li>Osteoarthritis</li>\n<li>Nerve pain</li>\n<li><em>And more</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Easy Hands-Free Treatment</h2>\n<p>The Conductive Neck Wrap will save you tons of time and hassle because you're free to move around during treatment. Perform microcurrent therapy while you relax on the couch, read a book, tidy up, or listen to your favorite podcast!</p>\n<h2>Adjusts to Your Body</h2>\n<p>With the help of a simple Velcro adjuster, this neck wrap will conform to the ideal size for your body \u2014ensuring unparalleled efficiency and comfort.</p>\n<h2>Wind Down with a Tension Relieving Routine Each Night</h2>\n<p>Try using this Conductive Neck Wrap at the end of a hard day and feel the stress, tension, and tightness melt away. Once you try this accessory, you'll wonder how you ever lived with the sharp twinge of neck pain before.</p>\n<p>*This wrap requires the use of a <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">standard red and black lead</a>. <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">Buy one here</a>.\u00a0</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
