    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><strong>Conductive Adjustable Hand &amp; Wrist Garment (Pair)</strong></h1>\n<h2>Precision Design, Unmatched Quality</h2>\n<p>With\u00a0one electrode strategically placed on the wrist, and another on the palm, this garment creates a steady flow of current intended to deal with wrist injuries.</p>\n<p><strong>Treat an array of wrist ailments with this can't-miss accessory:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Arthritis</li>\n<li>Carpel Tunnel</li>\n<li>Impact injury</li>\n<li>Repetitive stress injuries</li>\n<li>Rheumatoid arthritis</li>\n<li><em>And more</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Adjustable to Fit Your Body</h2>\n<p>With the help of several adjustment points, this Conductive Wrist Wrap will conform to the ideal size for your body \u2014ensuring unparalleled efficiency and comfort.</p>\n<h2>Easy Hands-Free Treatment of Your Hands</h2>\n<p>Move away from the confines of handheld microcurrent protocols. When your wrists hurt, the last thing you want to do is use them to perform treatment.</p>\n<p>For hands-free relief, attach the garment to your wrist/s, kick back, and feel the pain drift away.</p>\n<p><strong>If you experience wrist pain, this accessory could be the answer you've been looking for! Try This Adjustable Wrist Garment and enjoy the freedom of a mobile and pain-free life once again. </strong></p>\n<p>*You will receive both a left and a right-handed wrap with your purchase.</p>\n<p>** These wrist wraps will require the use of a <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">standard red and black lead</a>. <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">Buy one here</a>.\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> If you would like to treat both wrists at one, you will need a red and black splitter wire.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
