    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<span>This 130+ page, fully illustrated, user's guide is the definitive go-to instruction in the use and application of the Avazzia Pro-Sport III technology as used in <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/pain-relief-immune-support\">pain management</a> by individuals and Doctors worldwide, written by world leaders and first movers in Microcurrent Dr John and Lorraine Hache, PhD.\u00a0</span><span><br>\u00a0<br>This book was written as an introductory training guide for health professionals who have recently been introduced to Biofeedback Electro Stimulation Technology (BESTTM), Pro-Sport\u2122 devices. The subject matter contained herein covers the first of three training phases. \u00a0<br>\u00a0<br>In the hands of a skilled practitioner, the BESTTM device is an incredible tool for Biofeedback therapy, bio-electronic therapy and pain management. In reality, it is like a paintbrush in the hands of an artist. With the brush one may be capable of painting a Rembrandt or only a fence, depending on skill levels. Effective pain therapy is also an art, composed of many sciences, and skill must be acquired to use the brush that is Avazzia BESTTM to its fullest potential. This manual is intended to be a practical, simple to apply, fast to learn text for everyday use in practice of the art of pain management.\u00a0<br>\u00a0</span>",
