    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h2><span>Qi Wave\u2122 PEMF Pad \u2013 Gentle Yet Powerful Healing in an Easy-to-Use Accessory</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Qi Wave\u2122 PEMF pad is highly regarded by home users and practitioners alike for its ability to gently deliver deep, saturating PEMFs through any part of your body. These PEMFs work to address and correct impaired chemistry and ensure proper function of the cells\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u00ad\u2014thus increasing healing capabilities.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Why are PEMFs so successful in promoting healing?</span></h2>\n<p><strong>Pulsed Electromagnetic Fields, or PEMFs, work to: </strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduce pain</li>\n<li>Reduce inflammation</li>\n<li>Minimize stress on the body</li>\n<li>Reduce platelet adhesion</li>\n<li>Improve energy</li>\n<li>Improve circulation</li>\n<li>Increase blood and tissue oxygenation</li>\n<li>Increase sleep quality</li>\n<li>Promote healthy blood pressure and cholesterol level</li>\n<li>Aid in the uptake of nutrients</li>\n<li>Promote cellular detoxification</li>\n<li>Promote cell regeneration</li>\n<li>Balance the immune system</li>\n<li>Stimulate RNA and DNA</li>\n<li>Accelerate repair of bone and soft tissue</li>\n<li>Relax the muscles</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong><span>The true power of the Qi Wave\u2122 PEMF Pad is its capability to deeply saturate every cell in the body in healing frequencies, even penetrating through solid casts!</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>Learn more about the power of PEMF healing below:</span></p>\n<h2><span></span></h2>\n<p><iframe height=\"360\" width=\"640\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/262794139\" allowfullscreen=\"\" mozallowfullscreen=\"\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<h2><span>How does Qi Wave\u2122 Work?</span></h2>\n<p>Qi Wave\u2122 Works by generating a pulsed electromagnetic field with outputs that correspond to a microcurrent frequency generator such as your <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-pro-sport-iii-device-only\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Avazzia Pro Sport III device</a>, <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-life-evolution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Avazzia Life Evolution</a>, or <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-life-genesis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Avazzia Life Genesis</a><strong>. </strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>PEMFs take microcurrent treatment to the next level. Want to know how?</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>PEMFs of even the lowest frequency pass right through your body, penetrating every single cell, organ, tissue, and even bone without being altered or absorbed. As a result of this, Qi Wave\u2122 can even treat through not only bandages, but solid casts as well!</span></p>\n<h2><span>Qi Wave\u2122 Promotes Effortless Healing </span></h2>\n<p><strong><span>Sit on the mat, rest on the mat, lay it across your body, slip it under a pet\u2019s bed, or even under a child to passively promote healing, cell regeneration, relaxation and <em>so much more</em>! </span></strong></p>\n<h2><span>Trusted Healing Technology</span></h2>\n<p><span>Our PEMF devices have been approved by the FDA to be used in fusing broken bones, healing wounds, reducing pain and tissue swelling, and treating depression. PEMF healing is quickly becoming mainstream as scientists further research the numerous benefits of this technology. </span></p>\n<h2><span>Start Healing Today with Qi Wave\u2122</span></h2>\n<p><span>Qi Wave\u2122 is an ideal choice for passive treatment. Choose the Qi Wave\u2122 today and start delivering beneficial, health enhancing PEMFs to every cell of your body. Now is the time to start addressing and correcting the impaired chemistry that causes so many health problems. Try the Qi Wave\u2122 today and see what a difference it makes to your health.</span></p>",
