    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><strong><span>Conductive Eye Mask </span></strong></h1>\n<h2>Achieve a Bright-Eyed Look at an Affordable Price!</h2>\n<p><span>Our Conductive Eye Mask is a ground-breaking 21<sup>st</sup> Century solution to drooping eyelids, crow\u2019s feet, swelling, and tired-looking eyes. </span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Avoid invasive and dangerous injections with a gentle and effective microcurrent eye treatment that will have you loving the skin you\u2019re in! </span></strong></p>\n<h2>Easy Hands-Free Treatment</h2>\n<p>The Conductive Eye Mask will save you tons of time and energy when treating your eyes.<strong> Enjoy a microcurrent eye treatment while you relax on the couch, read a book, tidy up, or do yoga!</strong></p>\n<h2>More than Beautiful Eyes</h2>\n<p><span>Try the Conductive Eye Mask to treat pain around the eyes. Gentle microcurrent pulses will penetrate deep into the muscle tissue for effective and lasting relief. </span></p>\n<h2>Enjoy These Benefits of a Microcurrent Eye Treatment</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enhances muscle tone around the eyes</li>\n<li>Reduces the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and crow\u2019s feet</li>\n<li>Improves circulation for smoother, healthier skin</li>\n<li>Reduces puffiness</li>\n<li>Evens out skin tone</li>\n<li>Reduces the appearance of texture on the surface of the skin</li>\n<li>Enhances the production of collagen and elastin for younger, more supple-looking skin</li>\n<li>Increase cellular metabolism (ATP) \u2014 essential to maintaining optimal health, vitality, and energy</li>\n<li>Relief from pain around the eyes</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Works with the Microcurrent Devices You Know and Love</h2>\n<p>The Conductive Face Mask is compatible with any device in the <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/microcurrent-therapy\">Avazzia line</a>.</p>\n<p>Buy in Bulk and Save</p>\n<p>Because these eye masks are so popular in a spa setting, we are extending a <strong>bulk discount of up to 50% off.</strong></p>\n<h2>\n<span>Achieve Bright, Beautiful, and Pain-Free Eyes</span> Today</h2>\n<p><strong><span>Try our Conductive Eye Mask today and see how it revolutionizes your beauty routine for years to come!</span></strong></p>\n<p>*For hygienic reasons and to protect the eyes, be sure to purchase a separate Conductive Eye Mask for each person who wishes to use one.</p>\n<p><strong>**</strong> This device requires the use of a\u00a0<a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">Red/Black lead wire<u>; purchase one here</u></a>.\u00a0</p>\n<p>***For a product that targets the entire face, please see our <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/search?type=product&amp;q=face%20mask%20*\">Conductive Face Mask</a>.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">****Can be used with <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/tensive-gel?_pos=1&amp;_sid=42e114452&amp;_ss=r\">Tensive Gel</a>.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
