    "shortDescription": "Trigeminal Pads (Conductive Pads) Accessing Hard-to-Reach Areas and Promoting Mental Well-Being Has Never Been Easier! Never struggle again with performing micr...",
    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"color: #fe0000;\"><strong></strong></span><br>\n</h2>\n<h2><strong>Trigeminal Pads (Conductive Pads)\u00a0</strong></h2>\n<p>Accessing Hard-to-Reach Areas and Promoting Mental Well-Being Has Never Been Easier!\u00a0<br></p>\n<p>Never struggle again with performing microcurrent therapy. Trigeminal Pads effortlessly and comfortably reach ankles, awkward areas of the face, elbows, and much, much, more!\u00a0</p>\n<h2><strong>Jump off the Pharmaceutical Merry-Go-Round</strong></h2>\n<p>These conductive pads truly shine in accessing the trigeminal nerve (one of your cranial nerves).</p>\n<p>Cranial nerves are important in microcurrent therapy because they control smell, sight, eye movement, feeling in the face, balance, hearing, swallowing, and even mental well-being.</p>\n<p><strong>Now, it's easier than ever to perform the Trigeminal Protocol, which utilizes neurofeedback to address mental health problems.</strong></p>\n<p>Ditch the pills and try a pain-free and non-addictive treatment that revolutionizes the way we look at mental health in the Western world.</p>\n<h2><strong>Much More than Mental Health</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><span>Accessing the Trigeminal Nerve is key to successfully treating the following conditions:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sinusitis</li>\n<li>Toothache</li>\n<li>Tooth Infection</li>\n<li>Trigeminal Neuralgia</li>\n<li>Arthritis</li>\n<li>Traumatic Brain Injury</li>\n<li>Stomach Ulcers</li>\n<li>Plexopathy</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Easy Hands-Free Treatment</h2>\n<p><span>Trigeminal Pads will save you tons of time and energy. Perform microcurrent treatment protocols while you relax on the couch, read a book, tidy up, or do yoga!</span></p>\n<h2>Save Money and Save the Environment with This Reusable Accessory</h2>\n<p>Single-use products are a thing of the past. Our conductive pads are perfect for those who love our environment or looking to save money\u2014they can be reused up to 40 times!</p>\n<p><strong>Simply rejuvenate your conductive pads with </strong><span><a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/tensive-gel\"><strong>Tensive Gel</strong></a></span><strong> to use them time and time again. </strong></p>\n<h2><strong>Buy More and SAVE</strong></h2>\n<p>Save up to 17% when you buy in bulk. This discount is perfect for practitioners or home users looking to stock up on this essential accessory.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>\n<h2><strong>Achieve Peace of Mind Today</strong></h2>\n<p>Whether you are a home user or practitioner, adding a set of Trigeminal Pads to your microcurrent collection today is a genius move. These easy-to-use and affordable pads are going to be a game-changer for your mental and physical health.</p>\n<p>*Each set contains 4 \"size\" self-adhesive reusable conductive gel pads.</p>\n<p>**Conductive pads require the use of a<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"> <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">standard red and black lead</a></span>. <span><a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">Buy one here</a></span>.\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
