    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><strong>Conductive Adjustable Back Belt</strong></h1>\n<p>Never struggle again when trying to access hard to reach areas on your back.</p>\n<p>If you are one of the majority of people worldwide who suffer from back pain, you understand how tricky it can be to eliminate the ache and discomfort.</p>\n<p>This Conductive Adjustable Back Belt is designed with built-in electrodes that can be positioned to deliver gentle yet powerful microcurrent frequencies to the exact areas you are feeling pain.</p>\n<h2>Try This Top Selling Accessory Today</h2>\n<p>This back belt is a top seller for a reason\u2014microcurrent therapy is a revolutionary way to eliminate back pain of any kind.</p>\n<p><strong>Treat an array of back conditions with the Conductive Adjustable Back Belt:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Arthritis</li>\n<li>Joint Pain</li>\n<li>Muscle or ligament strain</li>\n<li>Bulging or ruptured discs</li>\n<li>Sleep-related back pain</li>\n<li><em>And more </em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Back Pain Treatment on the Go!</h2>\n<p>This belt is easy to set up, comfortably fits under a shirt, and offers pain relief on the go or at rest.</p>\n<p><strong>For treatment on the go:</strong> simply combine this belt with your microcurrent device and a\u00a0<span><a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/zipper-pouch\">Zipper Pouch</a></span>\u00a0attached to your belt, and you've got mobile pain relief wherever life takes you.</p>\n<p>*This belt requires the use of a standard red and black lead wire. <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">Buy one here</a>.<a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\"></a></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
