    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><span>Ear Clips </span></h1>\n<p><span>Deliver essential algorithms for relaxation and healing through the ears.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Ear Clips are an affordable yet essential accessory that will be a game-changer for your health and mental wellbeing! </span></strong></p>\n<h2><span>What Do Ear Clips Do?</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span>Ear Clips:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Reduce pain from chronic inflammatory conditions</span></li>\n<li><span>Calm the peripheral nervous system </span></li>\n<li><span>Reduce stress </span></li>\n<li><span>Reduce Anxiety</span></li>\n<li><span>Stimulate reflexology points in your ear to trigger a body-wide calming response</span></li>\n<li><span>Eliminate the tossing and turning of insomnia</span></li>\n<li>\n<span>Are essential when performing </span><a href=\"https://painfreeforlife.com/feel-the-energy-of-a-mitochondrial-recharge/\"><span>mitochondrial support protocols</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://painfreeforlife.com/polyvagal-theory-and-vagus-nerve-stimulation-putting-theory-into-practice/\"><span>vagus nerve stimulation</span></a><span>, and <em>much more</em>!</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>Slip into a Feeling of Peace and Relaxation </span></h2>\n<p><span>Ear Clips work to combat feelings of stress, anxiety, and depression by calming the peripheral nervous system and stimulating reflexology points.</span></p>\n<h2><span>It\u2019s Easy! </span></h2>\n<p><strong><span>Just plug them into your microcurrent device, clip them to your ears, and look forward to a body-wide calming response and deep, healing sleep.</span></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>Buy Two Pairs and SAVE!</strong></h2>\n<p><span>We recommend that our patients buy two pairs of ear clips, as losing one can throw off your treatment protocol and set you back in your healing.</span></p>\n<p><span>Because of this, <strong>we are extending a bulk discount of up to 48% off! \u00a0</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Try Ear Clips today and feel your chronic pain and stress melt away! </strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>\u00a0</span></strong>*Conductive ear clips\u00a0require a <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">Red/Black lead wire</a> to connect with your microcurrent device. If you don\u2019t already own one, you can find one <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">here</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
