    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><strong><span>Finger Electrode </span></strong></h1>\n<p><span>The Finger Electrode is a small but mighty accessory that can wrap itself around curved areas of the body like the face for better accessibility and ease of treatment.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Versatility at Your Fingertips! </span></h2>\n<p><span>The Finger Electrode is made from flexible rubber with electrodes that deliver gentle microcurrent pulses situated on its end. </span></p>\n<p><span>This electrode can wrap itself around fingers, toes, etc., for better accessibility to <strong>arthritic joints</strong>. It's highly effective for <strong>sinus treatments and\u00a0</strong><a href=\"https://painfreeforlife.com/stay-home-stay-safe-self-treatment-blog-series-microcurrent-facelift-the-holy-grail-of-at-home-beauty-treatments/\"><strong>cosmetic treatments</strong></a> as well. Treating these conditions with microcurrent has never been easier! </span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Try this effective and versatile accessory today and enjoy outstanding results at an extremely affordable price point!</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>",
