    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><span>Conductive Pads </span></h1>\n<p>Perform Hands-Free Microcurrent Treatment with Ease!</p>\n<h2><span>A Versatile Accessory to Complete your Microcurrent Toolkit </span></h2>\n<p>Our conductive pads are affordable, easy to use, portable, reusable, and versatile.</p>\n<p><strong>Conductive pads can be used at home or in a clinical setting to perform health-boosting protocols:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://painfreeforlife.com/feel-the-energy-of-a-mitochondrial-recharge/\">Mitochondrial Recharge</a></li>\n<li>Addressing <a href=\"https://painfreeforlife.com/microcurrent-the-best-natural-period-pain-remedy-weve-ever-found/\">Menstrual Pain</a>\n</li>\n<li>Treating Carpal Tunnel</li>\n<li>Treating CRPS</li>\n<li>Treating Plantar Fasciitis</li>\n<li><em>And more! </em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>Easy Hands-Free Treatment</span></h2>\n<p><span>Conductive pads will save you tons of time and energy because you're free to move around. Perform microcurrent treatment protocols while you relax on the couch, read a book, tidy up, or do yoga!</span></p>\n<h2><span>Save Money and Save the Environment with this Reusable Accessory </span></h2>\n<p>Single-use products are a thing of the past. Our conductive pads are perfect for those who care about our environment or are looking to save money\u2014they can be reused up to 40 times!</p>\n<p><strong>Simply rejuvenate your conductive pads with\u00a0</strong><a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/tensive-gel\"><strong>Tensive Gel</strong></a><strong> to use them time and time again. </strong></p>\n<h2><span>Buy More and SAVE </span></h2>\n<p>These conductive pads deliver results that will have you coming back for more! Because of this, we are extending a bulk discount of up to 22% to practitioners and home users alike.\u00a0</p>\n<h2><span>Add Conductive Pads to Your Microcurrent Routine Today </span></h2>\n<p>You won't find a more user-friendly microcurrent accessory than conductive pads. They are a must-have for anyone looking to bring the healing power of microcurrent therapy into their life.</p>\n<p>*Each set contains 4 2\"X2\" self-adhesive reusable conductive gel pads.</p>\n<p>**Conductive pads require the use of a standard red and black lead. <span><a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">Buy one here</a></span>.\u00a0</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>",
