    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h2>Conductive Face Mask</h2>\n<h2>Professional Results\u2014Affordable Price!</h2>\n<p>Ditch your favorite sheet mask for a supercharged microcurrent facial treatment that leaves your skin looking fresher, brighter, and more beautiful than ever before!</p>\n<p><strong>Microcurrent facial treatments work to tighten facial muscles while improving circulation, tone, texture, and fine lines\u2014without the invasive nature of conventional procedures.</strong></p>\n<p>Our Conductive Face Mask may look like the popular sheet masks that line drugstore shelves, but don\u2019t confuse the two. <strong>The Conductive Face Mask is much more powerful</strong>.</p>\n<h2>Younger Looking Skin with Little Time and Effort</h2>\n<p>The Conductive Face Mask can save you TONS of time in treating your face.<strong> Enjoy a microcurrent facial while you relax on the couch, read a book, tidy up, or do yoga!</strong> \u00a0</p>\n<h2>Enjoy These Benefits of a Microcurrent Facial:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enhances facial and neck muscle tone</li>\n<li>Reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles</li>\n<li>Improves circulation</li>\n<li>Treats sun damage</li>\n<li>Tightens enlarged pores</li>\n<li>Reduces puffiness</li>\n<li>Evens out skin tone</li>\n<li>Reduces the appearance of texture on the surface of the skin</li>\n<li>Encourages lymphatic drainage</li>\n<li>Enhances the production of collagen and elastin for young and supple looking skin</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Increase cellular metabolism (ATP) \u2014 essential to maintaining optimal health, vitality, and energy.\u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Conductive Face Mask is compatible with any device in the <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/microcurrent-therapy\">Avazzia line</a>.</p>\n<h2>More than Beautiful Skin\u2014Target Reflexology Points \u00a0</h2>\n<p>Our Conductive Face mask not only promotes young and beautiful looking skin, it also works to<strong> target multiple reflexology points on the face to decrease</strong><strong><span> stress and anxiety, promote better overall health, improve healing, and encourage relaxation. </span></strong></p>\n<h2>Buy in Bulk and Save</h2>\n<p>Because these face masks are popular in a spa setting, we have extended a bulk discount of up to 37% off!</p>\n<p>For hygienic reasons and to protect the skin, be sure to purchase a separate face mask for each person who would like a microcurrent facial.\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>If you want to:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Have younger, more beautiful looking skin</li>\n<li>Target reflexology points on your face</li>\n<li>Perform therapeutic microcurrent protocols</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>The Conductive Face Mask is a must-have accessory for your collection.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0Try it today and love the skin you\u2019re in! \u00a0</em></strong></p>\n<p>\u00a0<strong>*</strong> This device requires the use of a\u00a0<a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/wires/products/lead-4-pin-plug-to-r-b-pins\">Red/Black lead wire; purchase one here.\u00a0</a></p>\n<p>\u00a0<strong>*</strong>*For a similar product that specifically targets the eyes, see our <span><a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/search?type=product&amp;q=eye%20mask%20*\">Conductive Eye Mask</a></span>.</p>\n<p>***Can be used with <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/tensive-gel?_pos=1&amp;_sid=42e114452&amp;_ss=r\">Tensive Gel</a>.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>This item is not eligible for return</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
