    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><strong><span>The NEW Face Electrode - New design beginning to ship soon!</span></strong></h1>\n<h2><span>Convenient size\u2014Powerful Results</span></h2>\n<p><span>The NEW and improved Face Electrode has been specially designed to work with any microcurrent device in the Avazzia line. <span style=\"color: rgb(43, 0, 255);\"><strong>Please note: We do not guarantee what version you'll be receiving when you order.</strong></span></span></p>\n<h2><span>Designed to Last\u00a0 </span></h2>\n<p><span>The specially designed electrode plate works to gently deliver microcurrent pulses and has the added benefit of being slightly raised so that oils and creams will not damage it over time. </span></p>\n<h2><span>Easy to Clean </span></h2>\n<p><span>The NEW Face Electrode is also designed to allow for full 360-degree cleaning\u2014an important feature when you're conducting protocols like the microcurrent facelift! </span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Just connect it to your Avazzia Life microcurrent device using the standard lead wire.</span></strong></p>\n<h2><span>Unmatched Versatility </span></h2>\n<p><strong><span>The NEW Face Electrode is the go-to accessory for the following treatments:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Cosmetic Treatments</span></li>\n<li><span>Self-Treatment</span></li>\n<li><span>Little Wings</span></li>\n<li><span>Vagus Nerve</span></li>\n<li><span>Any Dosing Program (Three Pathways, Little Cross, Dragon's Tail, etc.)</span></li>\n<li><span>Fingers</span></li>\n<li><span>Ankles</span></li>\n<li><span>Between the Toes</span></li>\n<li><span>Sinuses</span></li>\n<li><span>Small hard-to-reach areas</span></li>\n<li><em><span>And much, much, more.</span></em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Try the NEW and improved Face Electrode today and enjoy the easiest to use, most convenient, and most versatile microcurrent accessory you've ever experienced.<br></p>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>SANA Shop Exclusive Accessory</b></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">As with our SANA Shop exclusive accessories, we cover manufacturer faults on this product for up to a year after receipt of the product. If you have any issues, reach out to <a href=\"mailto:support@painfreeforlife.com\">support@painfreeforlife.com</a> and we will replace it, or fix it.</p>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Requirements</b></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Face Electrode requires connection to any of our <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/collections/microcurrent-therapy\">Avazzia Life devices</a>, using our standard lead wire. <strong>Please select whether you need a wire or not for your electrode purchase. </strong>Replacement lead wires are available for purchase\u00a0<a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/lead-4-pin-to-2-5-mm-standard-plus?_pos=1&amp;_psq=lead+wire&amp;_ss=e&amp;_v=1.0&amp;variant=7135418908716\">by clicking here</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong>Cancelling an order that has NOT shipped is subject to a 3.5% processing fee. You may learn more about our Refund/Return policy <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/pages/refund\">by clicking here</a>.</strong></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Please note, this garment/accessory is not manufactured by Avazzia and therefore is not considered a manufacturer-certified garment/accessory when used with any Avazzia device.</span></strong></span></p>",
