    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h3><iframe height=\"360\" width=\"640\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/211221032\"></iframe></h3>\n<h3>Pro Sport Ultra Device\u00a0</h3>\n<div id=\"product_description\" class=\"description\">\n<p>Allows healthcare practitioner to set output mode parameters. Digital display patient REACTION readings and therapy progress indicators for professional use.\u00a0\u00a0</p>\n<p>PRO-SPORT ULTRA Modes include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Relax Assess</li>\n<li>Blue Relax</li>\n<li>Modulate, off, 0.5:1, 1:1, 2:1, 3:1, 4:1, 5:1, and 6:1</li>\n<li>Stimulate</li>\n<li>Deep Stimulate</li>\n<li>Blue Stimulate</li>\n<li>RSI</li>\n<li>Acute</li>\n<li>Acute Trauma</li>\n<li>VASO</li>\n<li>783 Harmonics</li>\n<li>PG2500</li>\n<li>HGH</li>\n<li>AVA - Programmable mode that allows user control of output characteristics - Power curve, frequency, pulses, Z value, damping, modulation, save and load</li>\n<li>and user save modes, VAZ1, VAZ2, VAZ3, and VAZ4 for saving AVA user selections</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT: Please note that the Pro-Sport Ultra does not qualify for our 90 day training or treatment coordinator support, you will be granted access to basic training information needed to operate your device.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">All Avazzia Life Devices must be powered by 2 high quality 1.5V AA Alkaline batteries (rechargeable-type batteries are not recommended and may negatively impact performance and void the device warranty).</span></strong></p>\n</div>",
