    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><span>Scalar Qi Tackles Chronic Pain Like Nothing Else</span></h1>\n<p><span>Scalar waves and their fantastic ability to promote healing are changing holistic medicine at its core. This innovative and hard to find technology was once cost-prohibitive, but that\u2019s all changed! Due to rapid advancements in this field of science, a treatment is now available for home and clinical use.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>We know our patients love this technology because it\u2019s one of our top-selling accessories!</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>Where the Scalar Qi truly shines is in treating chronic pain. Scalar waves work to block out noise in the area of treatment, allowing the user to get a better image of the underlying chronic issue. Once that chronic problem can be addressed, faster and more complete healing can take place. </span></p>\n<h2><span>Treat These Conditions with Scalar Qi</span></h2>\n<p><span>Treating chronic pain isn\u2019t all that Scalar Qi excels at. Address these conditions with scalar wave healing:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span>Insomnia</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span>Anxiety </span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span>Migraines </span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span>Plantar fasciitis </span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span>Hernias </span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span>Extreme nerve pain </span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span>Arthritis</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span>TMJ</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span>Decreased energy</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><em><span>And much more!</span></em></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>How Does Scalar Qi Work?</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>The Scalar Qi is a true Scalar device, generating a Zero Point Field by utilizing two Tesla coils inside of it. These coils when fired into each other produce the Scalar Energy.</strong></em></p>\n<p><span>Over time your body accumulates debris due to illness and injury. Scalar Qi works to remove this debris from the area, giving you a clean slate to establish healing. Scalar Qi gets you back to prime optimization by \u201crebooting\u201d an area polluted by this damaging debris, establishing an ideal environment for recovery.</span></p>\n<h2><span>What are the Benefits of Scalar Wave Healing?</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span>Scalar wave therapy works to:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Promote longevity and prevent aging by promoting regenerative healing functions</span></li>\n<li><span>Neutralize harmful effects of harmful EMFs in your environment</span></li>\n<li><span>Increase the covalent level of hydrogen atoms that hold DNA together</span></li>\n<li><span>Maximize nutrient uptake and cellular detoxification</span></li>\n<li><span>Increase immune function</span></li>\n<li><span>Increase brainwave coherence and mental focus</span></li>\n<li><span>Balance the two hemispheres of the brain (super-learning)</span></li>\n<li><span>Catalyze heightened states of awareness and creativity</span></li>\n<li><span>Create cumulative beneficial effects</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>Scalar Qi Works with the Microcurrent Devices You Know and Love </span></h2>\n<p><span>The Scalar Qi is an accessory that is compatible with not only the <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-pro-sport-iii-device-only\">Avazzia Pro Sport III </a>\u00a0but the <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-life-evolution\">Avazzia Life Evolution</a> as well (in addition to all other Life Devices sold on www.thesanashop.com). These top of the line microcurrent devices ensure that the Scalar Qi will function optimally. <strong>You NEED one of our microcurrent devices to power the Scalar Qi!</strong>\u00a0</span></p>\n<h2><span>Harness the Power of Scalar Wave Healing with Scalar Qi</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span>Ready to take your healing to the next level? The Scalar Qi is a powerful yet gentle tool that should be added to your arsenal. </span></strong></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
