    "shortDescription": "The Via Qi Attacks Chronic Pain with Revolutionary PEMF Technology Are you looking for a solution for your difficult to treat chronic pain? We\u2019re glad you found...",
    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h2>The Via Qi Attacks Chronic Pain with Revolutionary PEMF Technology</h2>\n<p>Are you looking for a solution for your difficult to treat chronic pain? We\u2019re glad you found the Via Qi.</p>\n<p>Pulsed electromagnetic field therapy is a cutting-edge technology that is revolutionizing modern medicine. PEMFs are a safe, gentle, yet powerfully effective healing technology that has been approved by the FDA to fuse broken bones, heal wounds, address pain and tissue swelling, and treat depression.</p>\n<p>We\u2019ve successfully harnessed the healing power of PEMFs by developing the ViaQi- a user-friendly, targeted PEMF generator that is appropriate for the home as well as the medical practice.</p>\n<h3>Who Needs the Via Qi?</h3>\n<p>Via Qi and the PEMFs it generates are exceptionally helpful when:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>you\u2019re not quite sure of the specific source of your pain</li>\n<li>for treating deep body damage</li>\n<li>for targeting hard to reach areas</li>\n</ul>\n<p>ViaQi is also effective in addressing pain in children as the gentle waves are practically undetectable.</p>\n<h3>How Does Via Qi Work?</h3>\n<p>The healing provided by the Via Qi is due to the PEMFs, or pulsed electromagnetic fields that it generates. PEMF waves pass all the way through every cell in the body, saturating them in the frequency required for healing.</p>\n<p>The bottom line: Therapeutic grade PEMFs are precisely designed to positively support cellular energy. As the PEMFs pass through your body, neurostimulation activates nearly every electrical and chemical processes in your tissues.</p>\n<p>The result? Better cellular health, improved cellular function, and profound healing.</p>\n<p>Watch this video to learn more about how pulsed electromagnetic fields work as we demonstrate their healing power with CellSensor technology.</p>\n<p><iframe height=\"360\" width=\"640\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/262794139\"></iframe><br></p>\n<h2>PEMFs vs. EMFs</h2>\n<p>Don\u2019t confuse body-friendly PEMFs with dangerous EMFs or electromagnetic fields. The Via Qi generates far longer wavelengths with lower frequencies that are explicitly designed to support and work in harmony with your body\u2019s natural energy field.</p>\n<h3>At all frequencies, PEMFs have the ability to:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduce pain and inflammation</li>\n<li>Diminish the effect of stress on the body</li>\n<li>Eliminate platelet adhesion</li>\n<li>Improve energy</li>\n<li>Improve circulation</li>\n<li>Improve blood and tissue oxygenation</li>\n<li>Improve sleep quality</li>\n<li>Reduce blood pressure and cholesterol levels</li>\n<li>Increase the uptake of nutrients</li>\n<li>Encourage cellular detoxification and the ability to regenerate cells</li>\n<li>Support a robust immune system</li>\n<li>Stimulate DNA and RNA</li>\n<li>Accelerate the repair of soft tissue</li>\n<li>Accelerate the repair of broken bones</li>\n<li>Relax tight muscles</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>The Via Qi is Compatible with the Microcurrent Devices you Trust.</h2>\n<p>The ViaQi is compatible with both the <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-pro-sport-iii-device-only\" target=\"_blank\">Avazzia Pro Sport III</a> and the <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-life-evolution\">Avazzia Life Evolution</a>. These top-of-the-line microcurrent devices ensure that the ViaQi will operate at its highest capability.</p>\n<h2>Kick Start Healing with the Via Qi Today</h2>\n<p>If you\u2019re determined to address your chronic pain and inflammation, it\u2019s time to consider adding the Via Qi to your healing toolbox. Nothing compares to the power and variety of algorithms at your fingertips. When you pair your microcurrent device with the Via Qi prepare for incredible results.</p>\n<p>We\u2019ve helped countless patients get back to enjoying life with this technology; it can help you too!</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cHaving a Pro Sport III, and the Via Qi is SO easy- it\u2019s Plug \u2018n Play. Not much worry about being terribly exact, yet so effective! My best purchase ever (after purchasing the Avazzia Pro Sport III).\u201d</p>\n<p>-Inger Grape\u00a0</p>\n</blockquote>",
