    "shortDescription": "Avazzia Pro Sport III- Advanced Microcurrent Technology Available Today The Avazzia Pro Sport III is our FORMER top-of-the-line microcurrent device, replaced re...",
    "fullDescriptionHtml": "<h1><span>Avazzia Pro Sport III- Advanced Microcurrent Technology Available Today</span></h1>\n<p><strong>The Avazzia Pro Sport III is our FORMER top-of-the-line microcurrent device, replaced recently by the <a href=\"https://thesanashop.com/products/avazzia-life-pinnacle\">Avazzia Life Pinnacle</a>. For those that still want the Avazzia Pro-Sport 3 model, we do still offer the unit.</strong></p>\n<p><span>Used by professionals such as doctors, veterinarians, and natural healers alike.\u00a0 This natural and effective treatment eradicates acute and chronic pain like never before and has been hailed as a game-changer for those with severe health problems.</span></p>\n<p><span>If you're looking to step it up and tackle problems like chronic pain, inflammation, depression, anxiety, insomnia, autoimmune deficiencies, broken bones, scars, muscle toning, and <em>so much more,</em> the Avazzia Pro Sport III has you covered! </span></p>\n<h2><span>Why Is the Avazzia Pro Sport III the Pinnacle in Microcurrent Advancement?</span></h2>\n<p><span>With over 50 preset programs, the ability to add your own and set the frequency of your device, the Avazzia Pro Sport III is capable of tackling even the most complex health issues with excellent results. The variety and flexibility offered by the Avazzia Pro Sport III will ensure your ability to address any health concerns that you or your patient may have.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Designed with professional users in mind, the Avazzia Pro Sport III Excels In:</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Muscle Stimulation:</span></strong><span> Facilitating the stimulation of damaged or degenerated muscles to relieve pain.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Pain Management:</span></strong><span> The ability to diversely and accurately manage all types of pain, no matter the cause. </span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Vagus Nerve Stimulation:</span></strong> Systemic anti-inflammatory treatment through the Vagus Nerve is a safe neurofeedback technique capable of flipping the switch on pain. The Pro Sport III is one of the few microcurrent machines on the market equipped with frequencies appropriate for use on the Vagus nerve.</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Chakra Frequency Sets:</span></strong><span> Which has been reported to balance the Chakras and improve emotional wellbeing throughout the body.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Acupuncture Frequency Sets:</span></strong><span> Stimulating meridian points utilized by acupuncturists to enhance overall health and wellbeing</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Solfeggio Frequency Sets:</span></strong><span> Our patients report that these high-powered frequencies help deal with neuropathy related pain.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Toning Frequency Sets:</span></strong><span> Toning the body to control weight while increasing overall health and wellbeing.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Advanced LINQ Technology: </span></strong><span>Enables the Pro Sport III to establish a pathway for treatment directly through the peripheral nervous system while measuring voltage throughout the body and its various meridians.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Access to Neurofeedback Frequency Sets: </span></strong><span>Which includes Alpha, Beta, Delta, Theta, and Gamma. These essential frequencies are the key to obtaining maximum benefit from the Hache Protocol.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>AVA Mode:</span></strong><span> Set your device to a fully customizable mode depending on your needs. An essential mode for utilizing more advanced protocols.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Four Programmable Modes:</span></strong><span> AVA mode provides a quick and easy way to access life-changing frequencies.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>More Than Just Microcurrent</span></h2>\n<p><span>Compatible with all accessories on TheSanaShop.com, the Avazzia Pro Sport III shifts from a microcurrent generator, to a pulsed electromagnetic field (PEMF) generator, to a Scalar Wave generator, and more \u2013 all within seconds, and with ease. This makes the Avazzia Pro Sport III a highly versatile unit that can be used to safely and quickly relieve dozens of common conditions at home, or in the practitioner's office. </span></p>\n<h2><span>Approved by Health Care Regulatory Agencies Worldwide</span></h2>\n<p><span>All medical devices on the market are subject to stringent regulation by national and international agencies.\u00a0 The approval process may include quality control, proof of efficacy, labeling approval, registration of manufacturers and distributors, and other thorough requirements. </span></p>\n<h2><span>The Avazzia Pro Sport III Has Been:</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Cleared by the FDA for sale in the United States</span></li>\n<li><span>CE certified for products sold within the European Economic Area (EEA) to conform with health, safety, and environmental protection standards </span></li>\n<li><span>Licensed as a Medical Device by Health Canada</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>Our Vetting Process </span></h2>\n<p><span>Safety and efficiency are our primary concern, and we have put all the microcurrent devices that we recommend, including the Avazzia Pro Sport III, through our own stringent quality control paces. We are proud to say that we at Pain Free For Life use these devices in our own homes, and stand by their quality.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Bonus Offer- Free Training!</span></h2>\n<p><span>All devices purchased through The Sana Shop, including the Pro-Sport III, come with a complimentary E-book version of the User's Guide and <strong>THREE FREE MONTHS</strong> in the Hache Protocol Online Training community.</span></p>\n<p><span>With this free three-month membership, you will receive unlimited access to exclusive video content that was expertly designed to help you master this technology and take back your life from pain, inflammation, and so much more! You'll receive unparalleled training and support from the breakthrough team that brought this technology to North America and shared its benefits with the world.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Try the Avazzia Pro Sport III Risk-Free for 30 Days</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Avazzia Pro Sport III comes with our <strong>30-Day Moneyback Satisfaction Guarantee*</strong>. Try it risk-free for the first month!</span></p>\n<p><span>Questions? Concerns? Want to chat about microcurrent therapy? </span></p>\n<p><span>Call us toll-free at 1-888-758-0851, and we will walk you through everything that the Avazzia Pro Sport III can do for you! Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are available to help guide you into a life free of unnecessary chronic pain, inflammation, <em>and more</em>. </span></p>\n<p><span>*A 15% restocking fee applies</span></p>\n<h2><span>What's in the Kit?</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Avazzia Pro-Sport 3 Deluxe Kit includes:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Avazzia Pro-Sport 3 Device</span></li>\n<li><span>Y Electrode</span></li>\n<li><span>Brush Electrode</span></li>\n<li><span>Pencil Electrode</span></li>\n<li><span>Conductive Pads</span></li>\n<li><span>R/B Leadwire (x2)</span></li>\n<li><span>Standard Leadwire (x2)</span></li>\n<li>Large Carry Case with Insert</li>\n<li>Manual</li>\n<li>Printable E-book of the Pro-Sport 3 Advanced User's Manual</li>\n<li>Two Months Free Online Training</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">All Avazzia Life Devices must be powered by 2 high quality 1.5V AA Alkaline batteries (rechargeable-type batteries are not recommended and may negatively impact performance and void the device warranty).</span></strong></p>\n<ul></ul>",
